        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "On November 19, 2024, we entered into a new At the Market (\"ATM\") program authorizing, but not obligating, the sale of up to $400.0 million of common shares from time to time.",
